<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Caw Ridge</name>
<Placemark><name>Waypoint</name><description>Where you need to get to: the Caw Ridge turnoff on Beaverdam Road, where the old road to the ridge leaves the gravel.</description><Point><coordinates>-119.324028,54.095806,1285</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Ridge point</name><description>The first point this guide was built on, high on the ridge in open alpine. It sits in a bowl with a short view.</description><Point><coordinates>-119.390728,54.062707,1991</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
