<Placemark><name>Beaverdam Road turnoff</name><description>Leave Highway 40 here, 8 km north of Grande Cache. The road crosses coal mine property: stay on Beaverdam Road.</description><Point><coordinates>-119.176448,53.924359,973</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
